{"seq":2,"slug":"fault-injection","title":"故障注入技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/chaos-engineering/experiments/fault-injection","wordCount":1624,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"故障注入技术\">故障注入技术</h1><p>把&quot;系统应该能扛住数据库变慢&quot;从一句愿望变成一次实验,中间隔着一个具体的技术问题:你究竟要往哪一层、用什么机制、注入多强的&quot;变慢&quot;?故障注入(fault injection)就是这套把抽象故障落到真实系统的工具箱。同一个&quot;延迟&quot;故障,在应用层是包一层 sleep,在网络层是动 Linux 流量控制队列,在内核层是篡改系统调用返回——选错层级,实验测到的就不是你想测的东西。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>故障注入按作用层次可分为应用层、运行时/容器层、操作系统层、网络层、基础设施层。层次越低,越接近真实物理故障,但侵入性和风险也越高;层次越高,越易控制和精确,但可能无法复现真实故障的全部副作用。下图给出一次注入请求从声明到生效的典型路径。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[实验声明&lt;br/&gt;注入什么·哪里·多强] --&gt; B{选择注入层}&#10;    B --&gt;|应用层| C[代码探针/SDK&lt;br/&gt;抛异常·sleep·改返回]&#10;    B --&gt;|网络层| D[tc/iptables/eBPF&lt;br/&gt;延迟·丢包·断连]&#10;    B --&gt;|资源层| E[stress-ng/cgroup&lt;br/&gt;CPU·内存·IO·磁盘满]&#10;    B --&gt;|平台层| F[K8s/云API&lt;br/&gt;杀Pod·摘节点·关AZ]&#10;    C --&gt; G[稳态指标观测]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H{命中中止条件?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[停止注入·回滚]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[到时收尾·分析]\">flowchart TD\n    A[实验声明&lt;br/&gt;注入什么·哪里·多强] --&gt; B{选择注入层}\n    B --&gt;|应用层| C[代码探针/SDK&lt;br/&gt;抛异常·sleep·改返回]\n    B --&gt;|网络层| D[tc/iptables/eBPF&lt;br/&gt;延迟·丢包·断连]\n    B --&gt;|资源层| E[stress-ng/cgroup&lt;br/&gt;CPU·内存·IO·磁盘满]\n    B --&gt;|平台层| F[K8s/云API&lt;br/&gt;杀Pod·摘节点·关AZ]\n    C --&gt; G[稳态指标观测]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H{命中中止条件?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[停止注入·回滚]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[到时收尾·分析]</pre><p>选择注入层的原则是:在能复现目标故障行为的前提下,选侵入性最小的层。要测&quot;下游超时&quot;,网络层注入延迟通常比改业务代码更干净,也不污染代码库。代价是抽象程度:底层注入对业务语义一无所知,无法区分&quot;这个下游慢是可容忍的&quot;还是&quot;致命的&quot;,因此低层注入必须配更强的稳态判据与更严的中止条件来补偿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四大类故障注入手法\">四大类故障注入手法</h2><p>绝大多数有用的混沌实验,都落在以下四类注入上。它们恰好对应<a href=\"../foundations/failure-modes\">故障模式与影响</a>中的故障分类,把那份&quot;故障词典&quot;翻译成了可执行的动作。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>注入类别</th>\n<th>模拟的真实故障</th>\n<th>常见技术手段</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>延迟注入</td>\n<td>网络拥塞、下游变慢、GC 停顿</td>\n<td>tc netem、代理延迟、SDK sleep</td>\n<td>触发上游线程耗尽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误注入</td>\n<td>服务返回 5xx、异常、超时</td>\n<td>改 HTTP 状态码、抛异常、拒连</td>\n<td>验证重试/熔断是否正确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源注入</td>\n<td>CPU/内存/IO/磁盘耗尽</td>\n<td>stress-ng、cgroup 限额、填盘</td>\n<td>可能波及同宿主邻居</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态注入</td>\n<td>进程/节点/可用区消失</td>\n<td>杀进程、关机、摘节点、断 AZ</td>\n<td>爆炸半径最大,需最严护栏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>延迟注入是最有教育意义的一类。许多团队配了重试和熔断,自以为高枕无忧,直到一次延迟实验暴露出重试没设抖动退避,反而在下游恢复的瞬间发起重试风暴把它二次打死。错误注入则专门检验那些&quot;快乐路径之外&quot;的代码——超时分支、降级回退、错误处理——这些路径平时几乎不执行,正是 bug 的温床。状态注入(直接杀实例)是 Netflix Chaos Monkey 的本行,爆炸半径天然最大,必须配合<a href=\"experiment-blast-radius\">实验设计与爆炸半径</a>中的中止条件与逐级放大策略使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网络故障注入-最值得深挖的一层\">网络故障注入:最值得深挖的一层</h2><p>分布式系统的绝大多数痛苦来自网络,因此网络层注入值得单独剖开。Linux 的 <code>tc</code>(traffic control)配合 <code>netem</code> 队列规则,可以在不改一行业务代码的前提下,精确制造延迟、抖动、丢包、重复、乱序。例如给某网卡注入&quot;平均 100ms、抖动 ±20ms、丢包 1%&quot;的网络条件,就能逼真复现跨地域链路劣化。<code>netem</code> 常用参数覆盖了绝大多数链路劣化场景:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>netem 参数</th>\n<th>模拟的链路劣化</th>\n<th>典型写法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>delay</td>\n<td>固定延迟</td>\n<td><code>delay 100ms</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>jitter</td>\n<td>延迟抖动</td>\n<td><code>delay 100ms 20ms</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>loss</td>\n<td>随机丢包</td>\n<td><code>loss 1%</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>duplicate</td>\n<td>重复包</td>\n<td><code>duplicate 0.5%</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>reorder</td>\n<td>乱序</td>\n<td><code>reorder 25% 50%</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>corrupt</td>\n<td>包损坏</td>\n<td><code>corrupt 0.1%</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>更现代的方案用 eBPF 在内核态拦截网络事件,粒度更细、开销更低,Chaos Mesh 等工具已大量采用。</p>\n<p>网络分区(network partition)是网络注入里最深刻的一种。它把集群切成互不可见的两半,直接拷问系统的一致性设计——脑裂时谁是主?写入会不会丢?这正是 CAP 定理从理论变成现场的时刻。注入分区时,延迟的累积效应也值得量化:若一次用户请求串行依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个下游,每个被注入额外延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>,则尾延迟近似累加:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{total}} \\approx \\sum_{i=1}^{n} (b_i + d_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是各下游的基线延迟。这解释了为什么&quot;只给一个下游加 100ms&quot;有时会让端到端 P99 暴涨远超 100ms——扇出越深,延迟越被放大,且任一环超时都会触发整链重试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"注入的安全设计-可控-可观测-可回滚\">注入的安全设计:可控、可观测、可回滚</h2><p>故障注入工具与真实攻击之间,唯一的区别是三个&quot;可&quot;:可控(随时能调强度、停)、可观测(注入了什么、影响了什么一目了然)、可回滚(一键恢复到注入前)。任何不满足这三条的注入手法都不该用在生产。</p>\n<p>实践中有几条硬纪律。注入必须有自动过期:即使控制面失联,注入也应在设定时间后自动解除,绝不能让一台机器永远卡在被注入延迟的状态——这要求注入机制本身内建 TTL。注入应当幂等且可叠加追踪:知道当前有哪些注入正在生效,避免多个实验意外叠加放大爆炸半径。注入还要与可观测性深度集成,把注入事件打点到追踪系统,使复盘时能把指标偏离精确对齐到某次注入,这一点与<a href=\"../culture/sre-observability-integration\">与 SRE 和可观测性结合</a>直接相关。具体哪些工具实现了这套安全设计,见<a href=\"../tooling/chaos-tools\">混沌工具生态</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>故障注入按层次分应用层、运行时、操作系统、网络层、平台层;原则是在能复现目标行为下选侵入性最小的层。</li>\n<li>四大类注入——延迟、错误、资源、状态——对应故障分类;延迟注入最易暴露重试风暴,错误注入专测错误处理路径。</li>\n<li>网络层用 tc/netem 或 eBPF 精确制造延迟丢包分区;串行扇出下尾延迟近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mo>∑</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{total}} \\approx \\sum (b_i + d_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>,深度放大延迟。</li>\n<li>网络分区是对一致性设计最深刻的拷问,直击 CAP 取舍。</li>\n<li>安全注入的三条底线是可控、可观测、可回滚;注入必须内建 TTL 自动过期,并打点到追踪系统。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"故障注入技术","id":"故障注入技术"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"四大类故障注入手法","id":"四大类故障注入手法"},{"level":2,"text":"网络故障注入:最值得深挖的一层","id":"网络故障注入-最值得深挖的一层"},{"level":2,"text":"注入的安全设计:可控、可观测、可回滚","id":"注入的安全设计-可控-可观测-可回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"实验设计与爆炸半径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/chaos-engineering/experiments/experiment-blast-radius"},"next":{"title":"渐进与自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/chaos-engineering/experiments/progressive-automation"}}